{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:04.954Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, olen Hieronta Maatti. Millä nimellä kutsumme teidät hierontaan?", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:14.062Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:14.278Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "No.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:15.202Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:18.622Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on teidän koko nimenne ja mihin organisaatioon tai yritykseen kuulutte?", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:31.686Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "No eklum ja Terveystalo.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:32.980Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:37.012Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on Teille mukava muisto näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:47.770Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mukavaa seuraa ollut joka vuosi.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:49.971Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Ja hauskaa.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:51.249Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:04:55.374Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Eli kutsumme teidät nimellä eklum, organisaatiosta Terveystalo, ja muistonne ATK-päiviltä on, että mukavaa seuraa on ollut joka vuosi ja että on ollut hauskaa. Onko tämä oikein?", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:05:12.385Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Tämä on oikein.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:05:13.259Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T06:05:16.174Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitoksia. Kutsumme teidät mahdollisimman pian. Kuulemiin.", "call_sid": "CA73c41b61cea67b8577fed103936ff02d", "stream_sid": "MZ741e96919641792f33444aba5687d663", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
